```text
Board of County Commissioners
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
Historic Courthouse
310 W 19th Street
Cheyenne, WY 82001
4:30 PM
Commissioners Board Room
Monday, August 4, 2025
PUBLIC HEARING TO SET MILL LEVIES
Roll Call/Call to Order
Chairman Gunnar Malm, Vice Chairman Troy
Thompson, Commissioner Linda Heath,
Commissioner Don Hollingshead, Commissioner
Ty Zwonitzer
Present:
Public Hearings/Rules & Reg’s
1.
PUBLIC HEARING regarding the 2025 mill levies pursuant to WS
39-13-102(g).
25 - 342
Mill Levy 2025
Attachments:
County Assessor Todd Ernst presented the 2025 mill levies. He noted the various
changes from last year’s mill levies. Chairman Malm stated that voters or the
legislature have approved all the mill levies.
Chairman Malm opened the hearing for PUBLIC COMMENT. Hearing no PUBLIC
COMMENT, Chairman Malm closed the public hearing.
A motion was made by Vice Chairman Thompson, seconded by
Commissioner Heath, that this agenda item be approved. The motion
carried by the following vote:
Malm, Thompson, Heath, Hollingshead,
Zwonitzer
Aye:
The meeting adjourned at 4:33 pm.
CERTIFICATION
I, Debra K. Lee, Clerk of Laramie County, do hereby certify the above to be a true
and correct copy of the Minutes of the Proceedings for Monday, Aug 4, 2025.
Approved by : Debra K. Lee, County Clerk
Reviewed by : Gunnar Malm, Chairman,
Board of County Commissioners
